#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-drotagx.rst:13
#: 53ccb9512ce342b4a592a81c68cbd412
msgid "`DROTAGx <https://www.airborneprojects.com/product/drotag-onboard-image-tagging-computer/>`__ makes geo-tagging easy by recording the vehicle's position directly into the images on the camera."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-drotagx.rst:15
#: 68704ef97b454e0da98faf7b90ccb574
msgid "Images are geotagged with the vehicle's Latitude, Longitude and Altitude (above sea level) at the moment the photo was taken.  These value can be viewed with any EXIF viewer"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-drotagx.rst:16
#: 78f2d7860f7f4061abcf354c9bbc8e92
msgid "Two text files are also created which include the image name, lat, lon, alt above home, altitude above sea level, roll, pitch and yaw"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-drotagx.rst:17
#: c629d2c6fdbb48a3a01a9f36e2414e01
msgid "Captures picture every 1.6 seconds"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-drotagx.rst:18
#: 93927be001cc42d881d7ff5aa4c0d18b
msgid "Includes a Hotshoe which connects between the autopilot and your camera's flash to improve the accuracy of the geo-tagging"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-drotagx.rst:20
#: bb6afac5e10b4977bd8dbab6a13b67a4
msgid "More details can be found in the official DrotagX manual (`web <https://www.airborneprojects.com/doc/drotagx/>`__, `pdf <https://www.airborneprojects.com/docs/drotagx_manual.pdf>`__) including pre-flight checklists, detailed explanations for diagnosis and other tips."
